@start
Hey, $name. <face:neu_smile>
How are you? <face:neu_grin> {
    ?: Doing well!
        That is great to hear. <face:clo_grin>
        # will fall out of this skip and hit "wrapup" goto
    ?: Not great.
        @bad
        Sorry to hear that. <face:concern_tfrown>
        Well... <signal:something>
        -> elsewhere
    ?: I've been... {
        ?: Worse
            Hey that's a start! <face:devious_tgrin>
        ?: Better
            -> bad
    }
    ?: I won't say
        Why is that? <face:concern_tfrown> {
            ?: Don't feel like it!
                Verywell... <face:neu_neu>
            ?: I don't know you!
                You will! <face:devious_smile>
        }
}
-> wrapup
@elsewhere
If you ever want to talk about it,
[branch]
    [when:slop=soy]
        do not be afraid to
[/branch]
just let me know.
@wrapup
Aaaaa
# Well thats it for this test... <face:soft_frown> <signal:hitend> <signal:bonus>
# Just always loop-back to the beginning so we can test the other options.

[skip:ta]
Blah blah blah
[/skip]
Fallback
This will run a condition
[branch]
    [when:check=result1]
        I detect result 1
        This like any other sequence
        -> wrapup
    [when:check=result2]
        I detect result 2
    [when:check=result3]
        ->ta
    [when:check=result4]
        [branch]
            [when:aaa=egg]
                -> elsewhere
        [/branch]
[/branch]
[branch]
    [when:checkalt=rez]
        Followup branch detected rez.
[/branch]
[skip:tx]
Blah blah blah
[/skip]
This is a fallback, it should run regardless of the branch
-> start
